  "prefLabel": "Plu 102.04 Master plumber",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plu 102.04 “Master plumber” means “master plumber as defined in RSA 329-A:2, I, namely \"any person, firm, corporation, or limited liability company that, as a business, hires or employs a person or persons to do plumbing work, or, without hiring any person, does that work as a principal business or as auxiliary to a principal business for his or its own account.\"\n\nSource. #8487, eff 11-17-05; ss by #8980, eff 9-20-07 (from Plu 102.03)",
